# winboot.script — headless smoke for ntos_windows (forgejo runs it under
# wine+xvfb). Exercises load, paint, input, SIP and scroll-drag; the
# wshot-final.png must be byte-identical to the Linux host's output of the
# same sequence (same payload code, same framebuffer).
# NOTE: never send key 0x1b while mode==M_BROWSER — the POC maps
# hardware-back-in-browser to PostQuitMessage (app exit).
key 0x74
shot boot
tap 294 504
shot menu
tap 120 80
tap 158 504
shot address
key 0x1b
tap 23 504
shot tabs
sip on
shot sip
sip off
drag 200 450 200 98
shot scrolled
quit
